      <Descriptions>
        <Description description="A request from the portal to complete or reverse a deadline, close a gap, raise or resolve a flag, or delete a function. The browser creates the row (table permission scoped to the signed-in contact, so Requested By cannot be someone else) and the CM - Process portal action flow does the work server-side: it checks the person may act, writes Completed By / Closed By / Flagged By / Cleared By and the archive row, and records the result here." languagecode="1033"/>
